Thymleaf:
server side java templete commonly used with springboot and spring mvc to create dynamic web page.
It lets you combimne html with java data so that the server generates the final html toweb browser.

common thymleaf attributes:
attributes    purpose                     example
th:text     display text              <p th:text= ${name}</p>
th:if      conditional rendering      <p th:if= ${age}adult</p>
th:each   loop through collection     <li th:each ="item ${items}></p>
th: href      creates url             <a th:href="@{/home}">Home</a>
th:value    set input value            <input th:value="${user.name}">
th: src     set image source          <img th:="@{/image/logo.png}">

expression types:
${.....}        variable expression
*{....}         selection expression(used in forms)
#{....}         message /internationalization
@{....}         url expression
~{.....}        fragment expression
